it's been about a week now of demon  slaying Diablo 3 ultimate evil edition  but I have a few tips to help you  continue the good fight in sanctuary  first and foremost make sure you have  elective mode turned on if you didn't  notice this it's actually a pretty  important feature that isn't turned on  by default elective mode allows you to  use multiple skills from the same skill  tree without it on you are only allowed  to pick one skill from each tree however  with elective mode you can pick as many  as you want so make sure you go into the  options and turn this on my next tip is  to make sure to take full advantage of  the massacre bonus the trap bonus and  the destructible bonus I'm sure you've  noticed that fuse in the middle of the  screen but make sure to maintain your  Massacre bonuses for as long as you can  to get the biggest experience bonus  multiplier possible the more monsters  you kill will equate to more experience  for you and your teammates once you've  reached about 150 to 200 monsters killed  the experience bonus will however cap  out in addition make sure you try to  kill as many monsters as you can with  traps as not only does it instantly kill  monsters but it gives you a sweet trap  bonus that will help you regenerate  resources at double the rate lastly try  to smash has many destructible items in  succession as possible to get the  destructible bonus which will give you a  speed bonus that will increase your  movement speed dramatically the more  objects you break the longer the buff  will last tip number 3 is how to become  the best bounty hunter you can be best  way for farming bounty bags and rift  Keystone's is to do them as fast as you  can even if it's on Normal difficulty a  way to speed up farming bounties is to  join a group online and split farm them  you and up to three other party members  can each do a bounty alone to get the  bounty bags done faster you will only be  able to do this in multiplayer though  and not on local land once you've  finished an entire axe bounties you will  receive a bounty bag reward the bounty  bags had the potential dropping you  random Legendary's but more importantly  they can drop act specific bounty  legendaries these legendary items can be  very powerful such as the royal ring of  grandeur which allows you to wear one  less set item to achieve the next set  bonus the bounty bag specific legendary  drop rates do not vary by difficulty  hence why I recommend doing them on  normal or whatever difficulty you can do  them  yet my final tip is how to become a  better gambler weapons amulets and rings  cost more than every other piece of gear  that you can gamble on choose your most  pressing need and try to gamble for  legendaries that will help bolster those  specific slots after you've gambled  through the pieces that costs 5 shards  move on to rings weapons and amulets  keep an eye out on plus elemental damage  percentage as it will greatly increase  your damage output but not actually show  up on your DPS charts these are just  some tips to help you with your long  lasting struggle and sanctuary slay  those monsters and become a true hero  you
 

